<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Monday show that net currency reserves rose to about 107.0 billion marks in the week ending October 23 from about 106.2 billion in the week ending October 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Oct 23	  Oct 15</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     122.8	   122.2</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.8	    16.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
